<section class="process-section" id="process">
  <div class="process-container">
    <div class="process-header r">
      <div class="tag">How We Work</div>
      <h1>Simple process.<br>Zero surprises.</h1>
      <p style="font-size:1rem;line-height:1.7;color:var(--gray2);max-width:480px;margin-top:20px">Every project follows the same four steps. Not because we lack flexibility — because this structure is what makes reliable delivery possible.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="timeline stagger">
      <div class="tl-step r">
        <div class="tl-dot"></div>
        <div class="step-tag">Step 01</div>
        <h2>Scope &amp; Quote</h2>
        <p>You tell us what you need. We give you a clear scope and a transparent quote. No hidden costs, no vague line items. You know exactly what you are paying for before we pick up a single tool.</p>
        <ul class="process-sub-list">
          <li>Site walkthrough and condition assessment</li>
          <li>Written scope of work document</li>
          <li>Itemized line-item quote</li>
          <li>Clarification call before you sign</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="process-callout"><p>"You will never be surprised by a cost. If something changes, you hear about it first."</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-step r">
        <div class="tl-dot"></div>
        <div class="step-tag">Step 02</div>
        <h2>Plan &amp; Schedule</h2>
        <p>We build a detailed project plan with every milestone mapped and every trade accounted for. You see the full picture upfront so there is never a question about what happens next.</p>
        <ul class="process-sub-list">
          <li>Trade sequence matrix with start and end dates</li>
          <li>Milestone calendar with key review points</li>
          <li>Risk log and contingency notes</li>
          <li>Your review and sign-off before mobilization</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="process-callout"><p>"Every trade knows the schedule before they set foot on site."</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-step r">
        <div class="tl-dot"></div>
        <div class="step-tag">Step 03</div>
        <h2>Execute &amp; Update</h2>
        <p>We get to work and keep you in the loop with structured updates. Daily or weekly, whatever the project demands. You will never have to chase us for a status report.</p>
        <ul class="process-sub-list">
          <li>Daily site log with progress notes</li>
          <li>Weekly summary with photos and next steps</li>
          <li>Issue escalation within 2 hours, not 2 days</li>
          <li>Change orders in writing before work changes</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="process-callout"><p>"You get a status report whether you ask for one or not."</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="tl-step r">
        <div class="tl-dot"></div>
        <div class="step-tag">Step 04</div>
        <h2>Deliver &amp; Close</h2>
        <p>The job wraps on time with full documentation. Clean handoff, no loose ends, no callbacks. You walk through a finished project and it is exactly what was promised.</p>
        <ul class="process-sub-list">
          <li>Full walkthrough punch list generation</li>
          <li>All punch list items closed before key handover</li>
          <li>As-built documentation and warranty information</li>
          <li>30-day follow-up call from the project team</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="process-callout"><p>"We don't call a job closed until you do."</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

